    "detailed_description": "Lights, Camera, Action!!!<br><br>Ultimate Action Hero takes you to a world of blockbuster action movies. You're a stuntman and your new job is to double for a famous actor who doesn't do his own stunts...<br>Shoot, punch, kick and blow things up! Become iconic badass from your favourite movies and experience intense action scenes. Do all that with an epic synthwave soundtrack!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Play in movie scenes which are a mix of exciting sidescroller gunplay and acrobatic action platforming<br></li><li> Explore Movie Studio and meet its eccentric Crew<br></li><li> Drive awesome vehicles<br></li><li> Unlock new Costumes and abilities<br></li><li> Search for hidden collectibles</li></ul><br>Do you have what it takes to be the Ultimate Action Hero?",
    "about_the_game": "Lights, Camera, Action!!!<br><br>Ultimate Action Hero takes you to a world of blockbuster action movies. You're a stuntman and your new job is to double for a famous actor who doesn't do his own stunts...<br>Shoot, punch, kick and blow things up! Become iconic badass from your favourite movies and experience intense action scenes. Do all that with an epic synthwave soundtrack!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Play in movie scenes which are a mix of exciting sidescroller gunplay and acrobatic action platforming<br></li><li> Explore Movie Studio and meet its eccentric Crew<br></li><li> Drive awesome vehicles<br></li><li> Unlock new Costumes and abilities<br></li><li> Search for hidden collectibles</li></ul><br>Do you have what it takes to be the Ultimate Action Hero?",
